  "_comment": "Curated extension API surface. 'status' is OUR implementation status and is maintained by hand: implemented (core handles it, tested), partial (works with documented limits), delegated (core validates and routes to the host browser, which must implement it), planned (not yet), unsupported (will not be supported). A test enforces that implemented/partial entries have a real handler and that delegated entries reach the host. Chrome/Firefox AVAILABILITY (engines, only) is synced from MDN browser-compat-data by Tools/sync_registry.py and checked by Tools/verify_registry.py; Chrome-only APIs that BCD omits (sidePanel, offscreen, ...) are maintained by hand. 'storage' is modelled by hand with nested areas.",
